1
00:00:00,812 --> 00:00:02,382
(Leonard:)Okay.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,950
If you need to pause
a little longer,

3
00:00:03,949 --> 00:00:06,279
just click the pause button.

4
00:00:06,284 --> 00:00:08,314
But the show must go on.

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,990
And thankfully, all the things
my girlfriend used to do

6
00:00:10,989 --> 00:00:13,589
can be taken care of
with my right hand.

7
00:00:20,932 --> 00:00:24,072
Anyway, let's not spend
any more time talking about her.

8
00:00:24,069 --> 00:00:25,339
We're here to talk about flags.

9
00:00:25,337 --> 00:00:26,507
Tonight's theme:

10
00:00:26,505 --> 00:00:28,505
flags of countries
that have been torn apart

11
00:00:28,507 --> 00:00:31,207
and the women I have a feeling
were responsible.

12
00:00:34,312 --> 00:00:36,482
(Leonard:)You guys have any idea
how much it costs

13
00:00:36,481 --> 00:00:37,911
(Leonard:)to see a marriage
counselor?

14
00:00:37,916 --> 00:00:39,416
$250 an hour. Why?

15
00:00:39,417 --> 00:00:41,947
(Raj:)How do you know?

16
00:00:41,953 --> 00:00:44,353
(Howard:)Bernadette and I have
occasionally gone to one to,

17
00:00:44,356 --> 00:00:46,256
(Howard:)you know, stay on top of things.

18
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:49,758
(Raj:)And I'm just
hearing about this now?

19
00:00:49,761 --> 00:00:51,631
(Howard:)Dude, just because
we're best friends

20
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:54,330
(Howard:)doesn't mean that I have to tell
you everything that goes on.

